    "description": "Architected and built the PlusAMedia Digital Signage Platform, a full-stack system spanning embedded players, cloud infrastructure, and AI-driven analytics.\n\nCreated the Prototype Design Language (PDL) — a modern, cross-language code generation system with namespaces, classes, annotations, and compiler-level abstractions that output C#, Java, PHP, C/C++, and JavaScript, reducing full-stack development cost and time.\n\nDesigned and implemented the Digital Signage Player in C++/C#, including proprietary AI and Computer Vision modules using SVMs and neural networks for real-time demographic detection.\n\nDelivered cloud back-end and business intelligence dashboards integrating user interaction, sales, and demographic metrics.\n\nPublished an article in 2018 detailing the platform’s architecture and impact.\n\nBuilt MiManjar Marketplace, an UberEATS-style restaurant delivery platform using PHP 7, Laravel 8, Vue.js, MySQL, and PDL.\n\nConsulted with Shiver / Mortal Kombat 11 to optimize and port C/C++ assembly code for the Nintendo Switch.",
